Package: asmtools
Type: Package
Title: A set of scripts for evalutating genome assemblies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Gen", "Morinaga",
      email = "gen.morinaga@ucalgary.ca",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: A set of tools used to evaluate genome quality based on outputs from external tools such as BBMap, samtools, BUSCO/compleasm, inspector, and Juicer. To cite this package, please cite the original publiation:
Morinaga, Gen, Darío Balcazar, Athanase Badolo, et al. “From Macro to Micro: De Novo Genomes of Aedes Mosquitoes Enable Comparative Genomics Among Close and Distant Relatives.” Genome Biology and Evolution 17, no. 8 (2025): evaf142. https://doi.org/10.1093/gbe/evaf142
